Real TZif files from IANA tzdata 2026e (python tzdata 2026.5), public domain. The engine's own tests read these
instead of the machine's zoneinfo so they give the same answers everywhere. They include zones whose rules
differ from the bundled 2025b: Africa/Casablanca (from 2026-09-23) and America/Vancouver and Edmonton (from 2026-11-04).
